📌 1. Dummy Node Pattern
> Use a dummy head to simplify edge cases (especially head deletion or insertion).

💡 Example: 203. Remove Linked List Elements

public ListNode removeElements(ListNode head, int val) {
    ListNode dummy = new ListNode(0);
    dummy.next = head;
    ListNode curr = dummy;

    while (curr.next != null) {
        if (curr.next.val == val) {
            curr.next = curr.next.next;
        } else {
            curr = curr.next;
        }
    }

    return dummy.next;
}

