📌 2. Two Pointer (Slow/Fast)

> Use for:
Finding mid
Detecting cycles
Removing Nth from end

💡 Example: 876. Middle of the Linked List

public ListNode middleNode(ListNode head) {
    ListNode slow = head, fast = head;

    while (fast != null && fast.next != null) {
        slow = slow.next;
        fast = fast.next.next;
    }

    return slow;
}

