📌 3. Reverse a Linked List
> Core operation, used in many complex problems.

💡 Example: 206. Reverse Linked List

public ListNode reverseList(ListNode head) {
    ListNode prev = null;
    while (head != null) {
        ListNode nextNode = head.next;
        head.next = prev;
        prev = head;
        head = nextNode;
    }
    return prev;
}
